<title>INDIA: CRICKET-INDIA 59-4 IN 2ND INNINGS V SOUTH AFRICA - CLOSE.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-INDIA 59-4 IN 2ND INNINGS V SOUTH AFRICA - CLOSE.</headline>
<dateline>CALCUTTA 1996-11-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>India were 59 for four in their</p>
<p>second innings, still 307 runs behind South Africa, at the close</p>
<p>on the fourth day of the second test at Eden Gardens on</p>
<p>Saturday.</p>
<p>Scores: South Africa 428 and 367-3 declared. India 329 and</p>
<p>59-4.</p>
</text>
